//! VM layer — PRODUCTION CANDIDATE `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-payment.sil`
//! (contract `PolicyVaultRootedToken`, generated by `tools/gen_v7_payment.js`
//! as an exact-match delta over the FROZEN `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.5.sil`)
//! driven through the real TxScriptEngine (covenants enabled, real Schnorr),
//! together with the PRODUCTION root `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-root.sil`.
//!
//! Gate I1 of docs/postlaunch/v0.7-organizational-root-design.md section 11.1:
//! the honest rooted-vault lifecycle (ownerControl selectors 0-4 under the
//! right root path, ownerRecover to the genesis-pinned recoveryPk, the
//! delegate spend that never touches the root, period rollover, and the
//! production Merkle depths agent 12 / recipient 16), EVERY vault-side hostile
//! row of sections 7.8 and 10.8 ported onto the PRODUCTION bytes, the D2 row,
//! the authority-layering (under-quorum) row, the coordinator's D6 rows, the
//! production-byte encoder integration, and measurement + standardness +
//! MAX_STACK_SIZE headroom.
//!
//! `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.5.sil` is opened READ-ONLY as the delegate-cost
//! baseline and as the D2 inherited-behaviour record; it is never modified.

